<title>USA: TVG Tech to post gain from Telegate.</title>
<headline>TVG Tech to post gain from Telegate.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>TVG Technologies Ltd said on Monday it sold 58,253 shares of Telegate Ltd for $1.6 million, leading to a $900,000 gain from the transaction.</p>
<p>TVG said it had an agreement on December 31, 1996, to sell the Telegate shares to a third party.</p>
<p>However, two of Telegate's current shareholders and an investor exercised their right of first refusal to acquire the Telegate shares on the same terms offered to the undisclosed third parter, TVG said.</p>
</text>
